<title>SOUTH AFRICA: PAG ACQUIRES ANCHOR LIFE ASSURANCE.</title>
<headline>PAG ACQUIRES ANCHOR LIFE ASSURANCE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>PAG Ltd said on Tuesday it had acquired Anchor Life Assurance Co Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;All shareholders of Anchor Life Assurance Co Ltd have agreed to sell their shares in Anchor Life to PAG,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>PAG said that the acquistion would be satisfied by the issue of 11.8 million PAG shares. It added that application had been made to the Johannesburg Stock Exchange for a listing of these shares.</p>
<p>PAG said that a circular detailing the acquisition would be posted to PAG shareholders by January 24.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
